[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 245.27, "timestamp": "00:04:05", "text": "所以，请稍等片刻。为什么这个功能不起作用？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 248.149, "timestamp": "00:04:08", "text": "好了，它启动了。最后。所以我们会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 251.67, "timestamp": "00:04:11", "text": "把这个人赶走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 260.069, "timestamp": "00:04:20", "text": "等等，那是另一个。这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 262.71, "timestamp": "00:04:22", "text": "最后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 275.43, "timestamp": "00:04:35", "text": "我的天啊。好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 278.19, "timestamp": "00:04:38", "text": "等待，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 286.95, "timestamp": "00:04:46", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 288.79, "timestamp": "00:04:48", "text": "看到我了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 292.55, "timestamp": "00:04:52", "text": "等等，为什么？为什么？我没有身体。我需要一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 295.189, "timestamp": "00:04:55", "text": "我需要等等，等等，等等，等等。"}]